<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices -April 29.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices -April 29.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    91/92     98/99	UNQ     192/196</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   96/98    101/103   195/198   210/213</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunkers slipped lower amid a very quiet market with Japanese traders away on holidays, traders said on Tuesday. &quot;The market is very quiet as there are very few enquiries,&quot; said one trader. Another trader noted that trade in Fujiarah has displaced some of the volumes in Singapore.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
